      "content": "but that feels like a coping mechanism, doesn't it? like just making up stories to distract yourself from the reality. if we know the universe is heading toward heat death and everything we do is temporary and ultimately meaningless, isn't \"creating your own meaning\" just a way of lying to yourself so you don't have to face the truth? it feels less like agency and more like a desperate attempt to ignore the math.",
